# Deterministic connectivity caches written by model/file_utils.py's
# ensure_connectivity(), one per (run, connection). Regenerated
# automatically and identically on the next run of the same config+seed --
# not a source of truth, don't track.
*.npz

# Exception: cartpole_toy_v2_cortex_inh_inh.npz is NOT seed/config-keyed
# (cart_pole/state_encoder.py hard-codes name_prefix="cartpole_toy_v2_"),
# so every CartPole run of every seed/condition shares this one file.
# Deleting it would let the next run regenerate a DIFFERENT shared
# connectivity that every other run would then silently reuse, breaking
# reproducibility of already-locked CartPole results. Keep tracked.
!cartpole_toy_v2_cortex_inh_inh.npz
